{"id":482,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"仏教精神で心を育む6年一貫教育","feature_description":"真和中学・高等学校は、法然上人に由来する浄土宗の宗門学校として、仏教精神を基盤にした心の教育を行っています。6か年一貫教育やアクティブラーニング、課外活動を通して、学力だけでなく人間性や協働性も育てる点が特徴です。校内にはコーラス部や吹奏楽部、野球部など多彩な部活動が並び、学年を越えた交流も盛んです。寮生活もあり、日々の生活全体で学びを支えます。","clubs":[{"id":9550,"name":"イラスト同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9551,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9552,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9553,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9554,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9555,"name":"クイズ研究会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9556,"name":"ベースボール愛好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9557,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9558,"name":"オーケストラ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9559,"name":"囲碁将棋同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9560,"name":"百人一首同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9561,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shinwa.ed.jp/kiji003194/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9562,"name":"将棋同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url"